#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:1
msgid "1.4 Rear-Mount Payload Installation"
msgstr "1.4 载荷上装"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:4
msgid "1.4.1 Payload Mounting Hole Layout"
msgstr "1.4.1 负载安装孔位图"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:7
msgid ""
"The robot's back provides a flat, level surface with a payload capacity "
"of 25–30kg. Two guide rails are deployed on the back, each fitted with 14"
" M4-threaded mounting holes to allow convenient installation of "
"top‑mounted payloads. The specific dimensions of the dual guide rails are"
" as follows:"
msgstr "机器狗背部的空间平整，负载25-30kg，背部部署有双导轨，两条导轨上有14个M4孔位支持上装载荷便捷安装，双导轨具体尺寸如下"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:9
msgid "![image](images/Payload_Mounting_Hole_Layout.png)"
msgstr "![image](images/Payload_Mounting_Hole_Layout.png)"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:9
#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:19
msgid "image"
msgstr "image"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:11
msgid ""
"**Once a payload is installed on the robot, only basic locomotion mode is"
" supported. Do not use the high‑platform mode once a payload is "
"mounted**<br>"
msgstr "**机器人加装负载后，仅支持基础运动模式，请勿在加装负载后使用高台模式**"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:12
msgid ""
"**Mounting a payload on the robot's back may affect its locomotion "
"performance. Please consult after‑sales support personnel before "
"installing any payload**"
msgstr "**当在机器人背部加装载荷时，机器人的运动性能可能会受影响，请务必在加装前向售后人员咨询相关事宜**"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:14
msgid "1.4.2 Center‑of‑Gravity Constraints"
msgstr "1.4.2 重心限制"

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:17
msgid ""
"To prevent collision or interference between the legs and a top‑mounted "
"payload while traversing various terrains, the D1 Max provides the "
"following recommended payload mounting envelope after payload "
"installation: 40 cm (L) × 22 cm (W) × 24 cm (H). The mounting space is "
"centered on the robot's back, as shown in the figure below:"
msgstr "为避免D1 Max机身上加装上装载荷之后，在各类地形运动过程中，腿部与上装载荷发生碰撞干涉，对D1 Max的上装空间给出如下推荐示意，具体尺寸为长40cm，宽22cm，高24cm，位置在机身背部居中位置，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/1.4Rear-Mount_Payload_Installation.md:19
msgid "![image](images/GoG_Constraints.png)"
msgstr "![image](images/GoG_Constraints.png)"

